      "content": "it's just a lot of uselessness. i can't even get out of my favorite chair without everything aching. my kids are so busy with their own lives, they only call to check boxes. i feel like a burden that's just being tolerated until the inevitable happens. it feels like i've lost all my agency. i'm just at the mercy of whatever slow decay comes next.",
