    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "breathing doesn't feel like control, it just feels like more time i have to endure. it feels like i'm just trapped in a body that's failing me, waiting for a long, messy end that i have no say in. wouldn't it be more dignified to just... decide? to have some sort of say in how the story ends, instead of just letting it crumble away piece by piece?",
